@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiểm tra máy chủ running -> 200
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Lấy danh sách bài tập -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Xem chi tiết bài tập 1 -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### 4. Bài tập không tồn tại -> 404
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### 5. Nộp bài cho bài tập 1 -> 201
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api"
}

### 6. Đọc lại lượt nộp vừa tạo -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 7. Nộp bài dữ liệu rỗng -> 400
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### [Mo rong 9a] Nop vao bai tap da dong -> 400 ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV002",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/sv002/bai2"
}

### [Mo rong 9b] Nop hop le cho SV002 -> 201 Created
# @name submitSv002
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV002",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/sv002/bai2"
}

### [Mo rong 9c] Gui lai y het 9b (nop trung) -> 409 Conflict (DUPLICATE_SUBMISSION)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV002",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/sv002/bai2"
}

### [Mo rong 9d] Xoa luot nop 9b -> 204 No Content
DELETE {{api}}/api/submissions/{{submitSv002.response.body.$.id}}

### [Mo rong 9e] Xoa lai luot nop da xoa -> 404 Not Found
DELETE {{api}}/api/submissions/{{submitSv002.response.body.$.id}}

### [Mo rong 9f] Nop lai cho SV002 sau khi da xoa -> 201 Created (id moi)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV002",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/sv002/bai2"
}